@@ -0,0 +1,268 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+# Vendored for MiMo-V2 FP8 decode (T53 prep) from vllm-neuron PR #67
+# (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-neuron/pull/67, whn09/vllm-neuron contrib-mimo-v2-5 a05ad1837fbf),
+# contrib/models/mimo_v2_5/src/kernels/moe_tkg_hits_batch.py. Only change: process_down_projection is
+# imported from the vendored nki_moe_tkg copy, whose down projection has the FP8 row-scale PSUM bank
+# offset fixed (nki_moe_tkg/__init__.py, D-209); the nkilib original computes the wrong scales on
+# T-tiles of 33-56, 65-102 and 129-170 rows.
+# Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. All Rights Reserved.
